NICL BLOCKED (link#227) — 1 blocking dam(s) on NICL's downstream flow path have not been modelled yet.

link computes accessibility by reading ALREADY-PERSISTED downstream barriers.
Running NICL now would mark segments accessible that are in fact dammed off, and exit 0.

  persist schema : fresh_default
  unmodelled blocking dams downstream of NICL:
    LNIC  564a572b-1de0-4ab0-9d78-51968e7be8a1   Nicola Lake Dam (psc 2)
  model these first, DS-first: LFRA, HARR, FRCN, THOM, LNIC

Fix — pick one:
  1. Model the downstream WSGs first:
       for w in LFRA HARR FRCN THOM LNIC; do Rscript data-raw/wsg_run_one.R $w <config>; done
  2. Model NICL now and settle access after they land:
       Rscript data-raw/wsg_recompute_one.R NICL <config>
  3. Override, if those dams are known passable / remediated / irrelevant.
     Recorded in the run log and surfaced by lnk_log_read():
       LNK_GUARD_DOWNSTREAM_NOTE="..." Rscript data-raw/wsg_run_one.R NICL <config>

