  model these first, DS-first: LARL, KOTL, BULL, SMAR

Fix — pick one:
  1. Model the downstream WSGs first:
       for w in LARL KOTL BULL SMAR; do Rscript data-raw/wsg_run_one.R $w <config>; done
  2. Model KOTR now and settle access after they land:
       Rscript data-raw/wsg_recompute_one.R KOTR <config>
  3. Override, if those dams are known passable / remediated / irrelevant.
     Recorded in the run log and surfaced by lnk_log_read():
       LNK_GUARD_DOWNSTREAM_NOTE="..." Rscript data-raw/wsg_run_one.R KOTR <config>

